    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2112310/extras/c6b20312b84b8ba93a574e110d2ca0dd.poster.avif?t=1679252420\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2112310/extras/c6b20312b84b8ba93a574e110d2ca0dd.webm?t=1679252420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2112310/extras/c6b20312b84b8ba93a574e110d2ca0dd.mp4?t=1679252420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The Drone Zone is an action survival shooter where you must defeat waves of killer drones to unlock the secrets of the bunker below.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>14+ unique weapons.<br></li><li>5+ enemy types.<br></li><li>Achievements.<br></li><li>Open, non-linear play area: choose when and where to fight.<br></li><li>Satisfying gun play.<br></li><li>Earn upgrades and choose your favorites.<br></li><li>Secrets and activities to explore.<br></li><li>Explosive weapons and ragdolls.<br></li><li>Retro graphics!<br></li><li>Super Performance Mode available for lower end PCs, so almost anyone can play!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2112310/extras/c6b20312b84b8ba93a574e110d2ca0dd.poster.avif?t=1679252420\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2112310/extras/c6b20312b84b8ba93a574e110d2ca0dd.webm?t=1679252420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2112310/extras/c6b20312b84b8ba93a574e110d2ca0dd.mp4?t=1679252420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The Drone Zone is an action survival shooter where you must defeat waves of killer drones to unlock the secrets of the bunker below.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>14+ unique weapons.<br></li><li>5+ enemy types.<br></li><li>Achievements.<br></li><li>Open, non-linear play area: choose when and where to fight.<br></li><li>Satisfying gun play.<br></li><li>Earn upgrades and choose your favorites.<br></li><li>Secrets and activities to explore.<br></li><li>Explosive weapons and ragdolls.<br></li><li>Retro graphics!<br></li><li>Super Performance Mode available for lower end PCs, so almost anyone can play!</li></ul>",
